  "CONTROL_DATA.lighting.switchByGen[2].location": "Inferred only from the section structure of the official manual: this generation has both a separate \"Light switch\" (Lichtschalter) section and a section on \"Exterior lighting — Operating the combination switch for the light\", which suggests that the main light switch was still a separate rotary knob rather than integrated into the steering column stalk — but the body text could not be retrieved, so it cannot be confirmed",
  "CONTROL_DATA.lighting.switchByGen[2].notes": "We could not obtain a reliable source for the exact operation on this generation, so it is left blank rather than guessed. Please refer to the owner's manual supplied with your car",
