  "CONTROL_DATA.warningLights[0].name": "Engine oil pressure warning lamp",
  "CONTROL_DATA.warningLights[0].meaning": "Engine oil pressure too low. This is one of the most urgent warnings — continuing to drive can score the bearings and destroy the engine within minutes.",
